    "body": "Cross doesn't really support cross compiling to MacOS/Windows as far as I can tell.\r\nOn my M1 Mac in can cross compile starship to x86_64 without any setup with plain cargo (but cross works too, but it doesn't look like it's doing anything). Windows should also cross-compile without extra setup to ARM64 once sys-info supports it.  Only Linux cross builds depend on `cross`.\r\n\r\nBut I guess it would make any feature *BSD builds easier.",
    "created_at": "2021-01-03T12:21:33Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-01-03T14:14:35Z",
    "html_url": "https://github.com/starship/starship/pull/2054#discussion_r550998596",
